{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "7e03f3543205814583dba550cb92d45e738211adae0fd625b491951fc0b84019", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-06 — Partial Credit Patterns"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "a89a575f27c325303f1ed277d3c3b2281e80a992cba7950b196a18ebbb4f3172", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues how the 4CH1 mark schemes award partial credit, as parsed in\nthe official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): step-pair splits, no-working\ncaps with fallback values, dependency-based one-mark outcomes, pick-N pool awards,\ndiagram-route equivalence and deduction mechanics. The patterns are read strictly off\nthe parsed text. Every claim is carried on a bounded, locator-addressed excerpt from\nthe run's evidence pack. Research artifact; canonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "ba442de1b3dc9afb7bc62add33e15293f6e21d9d0045604c26925c8abb62ccf0", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** step-pair credit; no-working caps and fallback allowances; dependency\npartial credit; pooled pick-N awards; diagram-route equivalence; deduction rules.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 2C/1CR, 2020-01 2C, 2022-01 1CR, 2022-06\n2C, 2023-11 2C and 2025-06 2C excerpt windows of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** full mark-loss catalogue (MS-05), marking-language lexicon (MS-07)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "0dfd9d049b7c08ef368f885a26b93fb9b79bebcaf1c793d100c3b9fa3112674d", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nPartial credit on 4CH1 is engineered, not incidental. Two-mark calculations split\ninto a method point and a result point; a bare correct answer is capped (\"with no\nworking scores 2\") while a wrong-but-defensible value can still earn one mark\n(fallback allowances); reasoning points that depend on an earlier point say so\n(\"M2 dep on M1 ... scores 1 mark\"); pick-N tasks pool their credit into a single\nline; diagram routes can earn the same marks as prose routes; and deduction rules\nstrip a mark for a named omission. The candidate-facing consequence: visible working\nis never wasted, and a defensible wrong answer often banks something."}
