{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "59e9837e405c147e408525a55b8843f6dfbb9040ed1eaeaab91ef328e0eeff62", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the run's pack of official extractions (bounded\nline-window excerpts across the 2019-2025 sessions listed, locators preserved;\nmark-scheme text cited verbatim). No examiner reports consumed; no specimen material\ncited; supplementary sources not consumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "f47fb25c6c21dca135031a706a94420abe13e1da521996518284208f093cf791", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe partial-credit catalogue covers the mechanics visible in the pack's excerpt\nwindows; several session files in the pack are identity-only (no excerpts matched\nthe query net) and contribute nothing here. Frequency of each pattern across the\ncorpus is not measured. No canonical planes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:rec:MS-031", "content_sha256": "1393dc7a01744e7ca4ca8be1ea21f7f567870ac154abc48f2f281fbe49bc6792", "heading": "MS-031", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-031", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-031", "text": "### MS-031 — Step-pair credit on two-mark calculations\n\n**Claim:** two-mark calculations print one point for the method and one for the\nresult.\n**Evidence:** \"- **(1)** (64 + 63 + 60) ÷3 / - **(1)** = 62\" on the mean-evaporation\nitem (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 172-186).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:rec:MS-032", "content_sha256": "521712d0a254fd7e5dd22de035433f63c6c34285226c1f92efcc95b5f70554a8", "heading": "MS-032", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-032", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-032", "text": "### MS-032 — No-working caps with fallback allowances\n\n**Claim:** bare answers are capped by printed no-working notes, while named\nfallback values can still earn a reduced award.\n**Evidence:** \"62/62.3 with no working scores 2 / ALLOW 69/69.25/69.3 for 1 mark\"\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 172-186); the Rf scheme's \"0.66\nwith no working scores 3\" and \"M2 0.6615 ACCEPT any number of sig fig / M3 0.66\nmust be 2 sig fig\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 282-296).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:rec:MS-033", "content_sha256": "c8807ef0c14f5771a9e94c294e3a7e0e14bd237f8c51204a913565ba177f72db", "heading": "MS-033", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-033", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-033", "text": "### MS-033 — Dependency-based one-mark outcomes\n\n**Claim:** a dependent point that loses its anchor can still score one mark where\nthe scheme says so.\n**Evidence:** \"M2 (electrons) can move/can flow/are mobile REJECT cations/atoms move\nfor both marks / M2 dep on M1 or mention of electrons i.e. 'electrons move' scores 1\nmark\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2020-01/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 220-234).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:rec:MS-034", "content_sha256": "f66d1e3a9e43cec2541b57715fd65a924afcfe708118af6e284c0cf7a3f11f92", "heading": "MS-034", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-034", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-034", "text": "### MS-034 — Pooled pick-N awards\n\n**Claim:** pick-N tasks print a single pooled point whose value is the count of\nacceptable picks.\n**Evidence:** \"Award 1 mark each for any six of the following: Method 1 M1 polystyrene\n(insulator so) reduces/prevents heat loss (to atmosphere) OWTTE...\" with its point\nline \"- **(6)** Award 1 mark each for any six of the following:\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2022-01/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 1031-1045).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:rec:MS-035", "content_sha256": "800c5f5c8791d69f87ee580ebb55342b0578dbab6dbdc212e817c1ef3ee41cf4", "heading": "MS-035", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-035", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-035", "text": "### MS-035 — Diagram-route equivalence\n\n**Claim:** credit routes through diagrams equal the prose route where the scheme\nsays so.\n**Evidence:** \"Both marks can be scored from diagrams showing correct electronic\nconfigurations of the ions.\" alongside the ion points \"- **(1)** magnesium/Mg loses\ntwo electrons/becomes 2.8 / - **(1)** oxygen/O gains two electrons/becomes 2.8\"\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2022-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 340-354).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-06", "chunk_id": "MS-06:rec:MS-036", "content_sha256": "1001064f8d5e5ba53ea632a794c261b1f505f93d9976f4673f3688e15f8ddc58", "heading": "MS-036", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-06", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-036", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-036", "text": "### MS-036 — Deduction mechanics\n\n**Claim:** schemes can deduct a mark for a named omission and penalise broken\nalternative methods.\n**Evidence:** \"Deduct 1 mark if no mention of layers/sheets/rows\" on the\nalloy-hardness scheme (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2023-11/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 274-288);\nthe titration scheme's \"REJECT incorrect ALTERNATIVE METHOD rounding for 1 mark\"\nwith the printed alternative route (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2025-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 550-564).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
